<title>NETHERLANDS: HBG first half net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>HBG first half net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>RIJSWIJK, Netherlands 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Net profit 53.0 vs 55.0</p>
<p>Net per share (guilders) 16.01 vs 16.87</p>
<p>Turnover (billions) 2.71 vs 2.61</p>
<p>Net operating result 57.0 vs 40.0</p>
<p>Depreciation 65.0 vs 69.0</p>
<p>Tax 12.0 vs 17.0</p>
<p>Interest gains/charges gain 16.0 vs 18.0 gain</p>
<p>Extraordinary charges/gains loss 4.0 vs 15.0 gain.</p>
